 <item rdf:about="https://maritime-union.com/job/231540/">
  <description>&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; San Ramon, CA&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#9;&lt;p&gt;An entry-level Galley Utility/Messman position is available on a US Flag fleet vessel. The role operates within the Galley Department, reporting to the Steward and Chief Mate. The anticipated hourly rate is $22.31, with an assignment length of approximately 90 days for unlicensed personnel. Vacation accrues at 25 days for every 30 days worked. Required credentials include a &lt;span class=&quot;caps&quot;&gt;USCG&lt;/span&gt; Merchant Mariner Document, &lt;span class=&quot;caps&quot;&gt;TWIC&lt;/span&gt;, valid passport, &lt;span class=&quot;caps&quot;&gt;USCG&lt;/span&gt;/STCW Medical Certificate, and &lt;span class=&quot;caps&quot;&gt;VPDSD&lt;/span&gt; endorsement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://maritime-union.com/job/231540/&quot;&gt;Apply to this job&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</description>
